CELL 28 — DIRECT INTEGRATED ARCHIMEDEAN TAIL
========================================================================================================================

Purpose:
Integrate the actual analytic Archimedean integrand over successive large-r intervals.

Parameters:
 c = 13
 N = 8
 working_dps = 80
 L = 2.56494935746153673605348744156531860480526794476020711641905

No asymptotic power-law assumption is made.

The reported interval integrals are SIGNED quantities.

